> **Farzana says:** Step cuts are honest. Asscher doesn't have brilliant sparkle covering up off-proportions or subtle inclusions. Every flaw shows in those clear, mirrored facets. That's why clarity matters more here than in round. At 2ct, VS2 is the floor — not the budget option, the correct option. And if you can get magnified photos before you buy VS2, always do it.

