## Lab IGI Asscher Cut — Price by Size

Lab-grown asscher diamonds carry the same physical, optical, and chemical properties as natural diamonds. IGI certification covers the same cut, color, clarity, and carat weight criteria. The difference is origin, not stone quality.

| Carat | Grade | Price | What this means |
